If an action's impact differs from expectations:

```javascript
function reviewCompletedAction(action, actualImpact) {
  const expectedImpact = action.expectedImpact;
  const variance = calculateVariance(expectedImpact, actualImpact);

  if (variance > 50) {
    // Significant difference - review estimation process
    logEstimationError(action, expectedImpact, actualImpact);
    updateScoringModel(action);
  }

  // Update historical data for better future estimates
  updateHistoricalData(action, actualImpact);
}
```

